      en: ["Built between the years 1932 and 1933.", "Designed by the local Vaduz architect Franz Roeckle.", "The south facade features a fresco of 'The Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse'.", "A relief of St. Urban reflects the town's winemaking heritage.", "The council chamber displays portraits of all Liechtenstein's monarchs.", "The building was extensively renovated and modernized in 1984."],
