      en: ["Located in the historical Mitteldorf district of Vaduz.", "The building's origins likely date back to the late 15th century.", "Notable for its distinctive crow-stepped gables.", "Restored between 1902 and 1905 by architect Egon Rheinberger.", "At one point, it was owned by the municipality of Vaduz.", "The structure is currently a private residence and closed to the public."],
