      en: ["The current bridge structure was completed in 1968.", "The bridge spans approximately 100 meters across the Alpine Rhine.", "It connects Balzers (Liechtenstein) with Trübbach (Switzerland).", "The first covered wooden bridge at this location was built in 1871.", "The bridge is designed for a load capacity of 28 tons.", "It serves as a key route for regional public bus transportation."],
