      en: ["The Kosthaus was completed in the year 1873.", "It was the first building dedicated to social housing in Liechtenstein.", "The building originally housed 12 worker apartments across four floors.", "The construction was commissioned by the textile firm Jenny, Spörry & Cie.", "The structure is a typical example of 19th-century industrial architecture.", "It is located in direct proximity to the former cotton mill in Triesen."],
