      en: ["Founded in 1858 by the Sisters of the Precious Blood.", "The founding sisters originally came to Liechtenstein from Alsace.", "The monastery operated a school and a girls' boarding house for many years.", "The architecture features simple, Neogothic design elements.", "It is situated on the scenic Schellenberg ridge with panoramic views.", "The monastery chapel remains a key site for daily prayer in the community."],
